    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>A sore lower back tooth when chewing; no hearing loss</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild ankle swelling after long runs in the heat, gone by morning; no chest pain, palpitations or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea on naltrexone; no abdominal pain, yellowing or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No shoulder or jaw pain with training</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rashes or sores</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headaches, dizziness, numbness or memory problems</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 0; no thoughts of suicide</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
