    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Brief discussion, read aloud and explained in plain words. He was asked who should speak for him if he were badly hurt in the ring or could not speak for himself; he named a health care agent, recorded in the chart and not named here. He said he would want everything done to recover from an injury. He chose to sign a health care power of attorney after it was read to him in full, with the nurse as witness, and was given an audio copy of what it says. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
